('Classic Turtleneck Knit Pattern', 18.00, 'A timeless drop-shoulder turtleneck pattern worked in the round from the hem up. Includes detailed stitch charts and photo tutorials for the ribbed collar finish.', 'Patterns', '/images/classic-turtleneck-knit-pattern.jpeg', 'Intermediate', 'XS, S, M, L, XL, 2XL', NULL, NULL, NULL),
